# From "Coordination Area" (Wave VIII - Union, CD3-6).

@segment  coordination-area
@title    The Coordination Area
@levels   F27
@duration ~5m

say Move your intention to the Coordination Area -- dedicated to maintaining and managing Focus 27 itself. Meet the energy beings who do that work. You're free to ask questions, and to listen.
pause 8
say Ask them about the inception, the creation, the history of Focus 27.
pause 10
say Ask how their management and coordination is actually carried out here.
pause 10
say Ask about Focus 27's relationship to the physical Earth system.
pause 10
say Ask what other systems, besides Earth, they're responsible for coordinating.
pause 10
say Ask what lies beyond -- what graduates of Earth School might choose next, for further growth or service. What possibilities are there?
pause 10
say And finally, ask for insight into Earth's own status as a developing system. Ask to perceive its stages, and something of where it's heading.
hold 60
say Give thanks for what you've learned. Make the intention to remember it.
pause 6
